773a1f5da4330a769ab3df0642a6b9.mp4?t=1760116070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Deadly Co-op Missions</strong> <br> Team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op. Coordinate, deliver, and survive\u2014or watch your coworkers get picked off one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080990/extras/97dfec82aca4eca8a6ebf5526fb46ee5.poster.avif?t=1760116070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080990/extras/97dfec82aca4eca8a6ebf5526fb46ee5.webm?t=1760116070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080990/extras/97dfec82aca4eca8a6ebf5526fb46ee5.mp4?t=1760116070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26\u00a0<strong>Physics based VR Horror\u00a0</strong><br>Built for VR with a physics based world, spatial audio, and proximity voice chat.     <br>Haul a variety of parcels, climb on other players or give them a slap of encouragement\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080990/extras/79daec518b2ebf5f810efefa8c249115.poster.avif?t=1760116070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080990/extras/79daec518b2ebf5f810efefa8c249115.webm?t=1760116070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080990/extras/79daec518b2ebf5f810efefa8c249115.mp4?t=1760116070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Monsters With Personality </strong> <br> Face off against terrifying entities, some may even look and act like your teammates. Learn their patterns \u2014 or feed them your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26f0\ufe0f Progression\u00a0</strong><br>Level up, upgrade your gear, grab a pet, unlock cosmetics!  </p>","developers":["Flat Head Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3743090","name":"Deadly Delivery"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080990/ce3bf0783956f0ec711bf4a13842e9eda702999e/header.jpg?t=1760116070","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Supported by Vienna Business Agency. A fund of the City of Vienna.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080990/1845556894/79eba8903364895098ddfe5525db38588417ce3e/1759404916/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759504806","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080990/1845556894/79eba8903364895098ddfe5525db38588417ce3e/1759404916/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759504806","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080990/1845556894/79eba8903364895098ddfe5525db38588417ce3e/1759404916/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759504806","id":257210690,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210690/movie480.mp4?t=1759504806","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210690/movie_max.mp4?t=1759504806"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572